        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Sagittarius &mdash; 3rd (Cloth Ability) Technique, gained at level 11.</em></p><p><em>Aiolos's shot travelled fourteen years to reach its target.</em></p><p>Choose a direction. The arrow travels in a line of any length up to <strong>one mile</strong>.</p><p>Each creature in the line takes @Damage[12d6[force]] damage with a basic Reflex save.</p><p>The arrow <strong>passes through walls, structures, cover, and any barrier with Hardness less than 20</strong>, destroying a 5-foot section of each as it goes. You do not need line of sight &mdash; only a direction, and the conviction that something is there.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
